      "name": "tool.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/tool/tool.ts",
      "summary": "Core tool framework: `Tool.define` wraps every tool's execute with schema decoding, friendly validation-error messages, automatic output truncation, and OpenTelemetry spans; also declares the shared Context/Def/Info types and inference helpers used by all tool implementations.",
      "tags": ["framework", "tool-definition", "middleware", "type-definition", "effect"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "Uses generic conditional types (InferParameters/InferMetadata/InferDef) to derive parameter and metadata types from Info, and hoists the Schema.decodeUnknownEffect parser closure once per tool init to avoid re-allocating it on every LLM invocation."
    },
