      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/tool/truncate.ts",
      "summary": "Truncation service for oversized tool output: enforces max-lines/max-bytes limits (configurable via `tool_output` in opencode config), writes the full output to the global truncation directory, returns a head or tail preview with a Task-tool delegation hint, and prunes old files hourly with 7-day retention.",
