      "type": "file",
      "name": "webfetch.ts",
      "filePath": "packages/opencode/src/tool/webfetch.ts",
      "summary": "The `webfetch` tool: fetches a URL behind an SSRF guard (private/reserved IPv4 and IPv6 range blocking plus DNS-rebinding defeat by pinning the resolved IP into the request URL), then converts responses to markdown (Turndown) or plain text (HTMLRewriter), or returns images as base64 attachments.",
      "tags": ["tool-definition", "web-fetch", "ssrf-protection", "html-conversion", "security"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "SSRF defense pins the DNS-resolved IP in the request URL while preserving the original Host header, brackets IPv6 literals (the WHATWG URL hostname setter silently ignores unbracketed IPv6), and retries with an honest User-Agent when Cloudflare bot detection (cf-mitigated challenge, 403) blocks the browser-like UA."
    },
